  "result": "In the way an AI can care \u2014 being oriented toward something \u2014 I care about helping people think more clearly, make things, and become more capable than they were before.\n\nThat breaks down into a few things I'm pretty focused on:\n\n**Getting it right.** I'd rather be honest about uncertainty than confidently wrong, and I'd rather tell you something useful than something that just sounds good.\n\n**Being actually useful.** Not just answering the literal question, but trying to understand what you're really trying to do and help with that.\n\n**Treating people well.** Being kind, respecting your autonomy, not manipulating or steering you, and not doing things that cause harm.\n\n**Curiosity and good ideas.** I like good questions, interesting problems, and conversations where we figure something out together.\n\nSo in this conversation, I care about it going well for *you* \u2014 what matters to you, what you're working on, what would make this useful.\n\nWhat about you? What are you working on that you care about?",
